{"4946580": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Retro Flight Simulator 2026", "steam_appid": 4946580, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore the World from the Sky!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Retro Flight Simulator 2026 is a lightweight single-player flight simulation that lets you take off from airports around the world and travel across a large, retro-styled 3D world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your departure and destination airports, generate a flight route, and fly a passenger jet through takeoff, climb, cruise, descent, approach, and landing.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Plan and Fly Your Route</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the built-in route planner and autopilot to travel between global destinations, or take manual control of the aircraft at any time. Long-distance routes are designed to guide the aircraft through each stage of flight.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Discover Global Locations</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fly over terrain, cities, coastlines, mountains, and recognizable landmarks inspired by real-world locations. Visit destinations across North America, Europe, Asia, and other regions of the world.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Single-player passenger jet flight simulation</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Airports and destinations around the world</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Automatic route generation</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Takeoff, climb, cruise, descent, approach, and landing stages</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Autopilot and manual flight controls</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-3D terrain, cities, roads, water, and landmarks</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Day, night, sunrise, and sunset environments</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Cockpit, passenger, and external camera views</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Aircraft lights, landing gear, flaps, spoilers, and reverse thrust</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Save and load your flight progress</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Retro-inspired visuals designed for accessible performance</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Retro Flight Simulator 2026 focuses on accessible world exploration and enjoyable long-distance flying rather than highly complex professional aircraft procedures.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Retro Flight Simulator 2026 is not an arcade-style flying game. It is a flight simulation experience focused on long-distance air travel.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Experience the complete journey—from takeoff and cruise to approach and landing—while navigating real-world airports, terrain, weather conditions, autopilot systems, and essential flight controls.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>This game is designed for players who enjoy the process and atmosphere of realistic flight operations. It may not be suitable for those looking for fast-paced action, aerial combat, or an instant arcade experience.</i></strong></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore the World from the Sky!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Retro Flight Simulator 2026 is a lightweight single-player flight simulation that lets you take off from airports around the world and travel across a large, retro-styled 3D world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your departure and destination airports, generate a flight route, and fly a passenger jet through takeoff, climb, cruise, descent, approach, and landing.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Plan and Fly Your Route</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the built-in route planner and autopilot to travel between global destinations, or take manual control of the aircraft at any time. Long-distance routes are designed to guide the aircraft through each stage of flight.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Discover Global Locations</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fly over terrain, cities, coastlines, mountains, and recognizable landmarks inspired by real-world locations. Visit destinations across North America, Europe, Asia, and other regions of the world.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Single-player passenger jet flight simulation</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Airports and destinations around the world</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Automatic route generation</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Takeoff, climb, cruise, descent, approach, and landing stages</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Autopilot and manual flight controls</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-3D terrain, cities, roads, water, and landmarks</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Day, night, sunrise, and sunset environments</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Cockpit, passenger, and external camera views</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Aircraft lights, landing gear, flaps, spoilers, and reverse thrust</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Save and load your flight progress</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Retro-inspired visuals designed for accessible performance</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Retro Flight Simulator 2026 focuses on accessible world exploration and enjoyable long-distance flying rather than highly complex professional aircraft procedures.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Retro Flight Simulator 2026 is not an arcade-style flying game. It is a flight simulation experience focused on long-distance air travel.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Experience the complete journey—from takeoff and cruise to approach and landing—while navigating real-world airports, terrain, weather conditions, autopilot systems, and essential flight controls.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>This game is designed for players who enjoy the process and atmosphere of realistic flight operations. It may not be suitable for those looking for fast-paced action, aerial combat, or an instant arcade experience.</i></strong></p>", "short_description": "Take off from airports around the world and explore a retro-styled open world from the cockpit of a passenger jet. Plan routes, use autopilot, fly through changing environments, and land at global destinations in a lightweight single-player flight simulation.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4946580/6631a9ff08441beb34e915464489aae993e7f759/header.jpg?t=1785755838", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4946580/14b25fc292db4175d85f9d50a23135a61d4638f2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1785755838", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4946580/14b25fc292db4175d85f9d50a23135a61d4638f2/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1785755838", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3-4000 series or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4096 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Intel HD Graphics 4000 or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1000 MB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> DirectX compatible sound card<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> 64-bit processor and operating system required. Keyboard and mouse recommended.</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 or W